            {
                "entry_id": "413ccc1a-e3fe-3083-a8ae-ff78517ed1f6",
                "word": "epidural",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "f4275fc0-1687-4e84-afd1-29e997d30bfb",
                        "entry_id": "413ccc1a-e3fe-3083-a8ae-ff78517ed1f6",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "epidurals"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9e6a6da7-2dce-3969-9eb8-dbee16f44834",
                        "entry_id": "413ccc1a-e3fe-3083-a8ae-ff78517ed1f6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An injection of anaesthetic into the epidural space of the spine, especially associated with pain relief during childbirth."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5fd90c2d-b9f0-491b-94f5-537e709e0257",
                                "sense_id": "9e6a6da7-2dce-3969-9eb8-dbee16f44834",
                                "text": "For reasons I shan’t bore you with, I got them to induce me at 39 weeks, at 10am, with the epidural going in first, and it was all a dream. Until the baby went back to back and they very nicely pointed out that the epidural doesn’t deal with that pain."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b9684d2a-9c55-43c9-ac42-8b2850f9de57",
                        "source_entry_id": "413ccc1a-e3fe-3083-a8ae-ff78517ed1f6",
                        "source_sense_id": "9e6a6da7-2dce-3969-9eb8-dbee16f44834",
                        "source_sense_description": "anaesthetic",
                        "target_lang_word": "péridurale",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "péridurale",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3d28b737-73f0-3b44-98ca-06b91420824f",
                                        "entry_id": "9667ad02-4a08-3b6f-aca7-29d37550a55e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Technique d’anesthésie loco-régionale consistant à introduire un cathéter dans l’espace péridural permettant la diffusion d'un produit actif (analgésique, anesthésique, glucocorticoïde…)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dfc2a6c1-10f5-41a2-a20a-9ec2ae1acb7f",
                                                "sense_id": "3d28b737-73f0-3b44-98ca-06b91420824f",
                                                "text": "Les effets de la péridurale disparaissent généralement dans les heures qui suivent le retrait du cathéter."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "84900260-7fda-3be5-a289-792547d57408",
                                        "entry_id": "9667ad02-4a08-3b6f-aca7-29d37550a55e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Cette technique utilisée lors de l'accouchement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "especially"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1c97db51-452c-459d-9c52-29cc6cb934f2",
                                                "sense_id": "84900260-7fda-3be5-a289-792547d57408",
                                                "text": "La péridurale qui risque de ralentir le travail, l’injection d’ocytocine de synthèse pour accélérer les contractions, la contrainte d’accoucher allongée, l’épisiotomie... : autant d’éléments jadis acceptés sans broncher, désormais contestés par de nombreux jeunes parents, qui réclament un accouchement plus naturel."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "péridurale",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7cb56dc2-1f0f-3afd-8278-e649a4da3065",
                                        "entry_id": "1bac2d92-ec71-395f-93c6-1e8b0f2f132c",
